{"id":"9a7e2d6d7ea972c3","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-factoring-in-bqp.md","title":"Factoring is in BQP","display":"thm-factoring-in-bqp — Factoring is in BQP","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-factoring-in-bqp","aliases":["28-thm-factoring-in-bqp","Factoring is in BQP","Shor's Algorithm"],"display":"thm-factoring-in-bqp — Factoring is in BQP","depends_on":["[[28-df-bqp]]","[[28-df-quantum-circuit]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 10.15; §10.6","source_printed_pages":"222–228","source_pdf_pages":"248–254","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-factoring-in-bqp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-factoring-in-bqp</span><span>Factoring is in BQP</span><span>Shor's Algorithm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-factoring-in-bqp — Factoring is in BQP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c0486b96e648a9d6\" href=\"?note=c0486b96e648a9d6\" title=\"28-df-bqp\">28-df-bqp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b4588e429e73283a\" href=\"?note=b4588e429e73283a\" title=\"28-df-quantum-circuit\">28-df-quantum-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 10.15; §10.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"222–228"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"248–254"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BQP}\">\\(\\mathbf{BQP}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{QCirc}_m\">\\(\\mathbf{QCirc}_m\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Out}_C\">\\(\\operatorname{Out}_C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QU}\">\\(\\operatorname{QU}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c0486b96e648a9d6\" href=\"?note=c0486b96e648a9d6\" title=\"28-df-bqp\">28-df-bqp</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b4588e429e73283a\" href=\"?note=b4588e429e73283a\" title=\"28-df-quantum-circuit\">28-df-quantum-circuit</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(N)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(N)\\)</span> 为正整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 的无前导零二进制表示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N[n]\">\\(\\mathbb N[n]\\)</span> 是非负整数系数一元多项式集合；空乘积取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_m\">\\(C\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_m\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\Sigma^{\\le m}\">\\(x\\in\\Sigma^{\\le m}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QOut}_C(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{QOut}_C(x)\\)</span> 是值域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^m\">\\(\\Sigma^m\\)</span> 的随机变量，其概率质量由下式定义。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}\">\\(\\operatorname{Prime}\\)</span>、正整数对序列集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span>、质因数分解关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PF}\">\\(\\mathsf{PF}\\)</span> 及列表编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{pf}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{pf}}\\)</span> 均在下式内定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V=(V_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathcal V=(V_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(G\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 为确定型测量后处理算法；字串乘积按序拼接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow p\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\land\\forall d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;(d\\mid p\\Rightarrow(d=1\\lor d=p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Prime}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow p\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\land\\forall d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;(d\\mid p\\Rightarrow(d=1\\lor d=p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{t\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}(\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\times\\mathbb N_{\\ge1})^t,\\qquad\\operatorname{cint}(v)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(v)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(v)\\quad(v\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{t\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}(\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\times\\mathbb N_{\\ge1})^t,\\qquad\\operatorname{cint}(v)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(v)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(v)\\quad(v\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{pf}}(((p_j,e_j))_{j=1}^t)\\coloneqq1^t0\\prod_{j=1}^t\\bigl(\\operatorname{cint}(p_j)\\operatorname{cint}(e_j)\\bigr)\\quad(((p_j,e_j))_{j=1}^t\\in\\mathcal T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{pf}}(((p_j,e_j))_{j=1}^t)\\coloneqq1^t0\\prod_{j=1}^t\\bigl(\\operatorname{cint}(p_j)\\operatorname{cint}(e_j)\\bigr)\\quad(((p_j,e_j))_{j=1}^t\\in\\mathcal T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PF}(N)\\coloneqq\\{((p_j,e_j))_{j=1}^t\\in\\mathcal T:\\forall j\\in[t]\\;\\operatorname{Prime}(p_j),\\ \\forall j\\in[t-1]\\;p_j&lt;p_{j+1},\\ N=\\prod_{j=1}^t p_j^{e_j}\\}\\quad(N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PF}(N)\\coloneqq\\{((p_j,e_j))_{j=1}^t\\in\\mathcal T:\\forall j\\in[t]\\;\\operatorname{Prime}(p_j),\\ \\forall j\\in[t-1]\\;p_j&lt;p_{j+1},\\ N=\\prod_{j=1}^t p_j^{e_j}\\}\\quad(N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pr[\\operatorname{QOut}_C(x)=y]\\coloneqq\\langle y|\\operatorname{Out}_C(|x0^{m-|x|}\\rangle\\langle x0^{m-|x|}|)|y\\rangle\\quad(C\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_m,\\ x\\in\\Sigma^{\\le m},\\ y\\in\\Sigma^m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pr[\\operatorname{QOut}_C(x)=y]\\coloneqq\\langle y|\\operatorname{Out}_C(|x0^{m-|x|}\\rangle\\langle x0^{m-|x|}|)|y\\rangle\\quad(C\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_m,\\ x\\in\\Sigma^{\\le m},\\ y\\in\\Sigma^m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\exists a,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\;\\exists\\mathcal V\\;\\exists G\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\quad[&amp;\\operatorname{QU}(\\mathcal V)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(V_n\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_{n+a(n)}\\land\\operatorname{size}(V_n)\\le p(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\quad\\Pr\\left[G\\left(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\left(\\operatorname{bin}(N),\\operatorname{QOut}_{V_{|\\operatorname{bin}(N)|}}(\\operatorname{bin}(N))\\right)\\right)\\in\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{pf}}(z):z\\in\\mathsf{PF}(N)\\}\\right]\\ge2/3].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\exists a,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\;\\exists\\mathcal V\\;\\exists G\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\quad[&amp;\\operatorname{QU}(\\mathcal V)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(V_n\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_{n+a(n)}\\land\\operatorname{size}(V_n)\\le p(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\quad\\Pr\\left[G\\left(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\left(\\operatorname{bin}(N),\\operatorname{QOut}_{V_{|\\operatorname{bin}(N)|}}(\\operatorname{bin}(N))\\right)\\right)\\in\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{pf}}(z):z\\in\\mathsf{PF}(N)\\}\\right]\\ge2/3].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FACTOR}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(\\operatorname{bin}(N),\\operatorname{bin}(k)):N,k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2},\\ \\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\;(1&lt;d&lt;N\\land d\\le k\\land d\\mid N)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{FACTOR}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(\\operatorname{bin}(N),\\operatorname{bin}(k)):N,k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2},\\ \\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\;(1&lt;d&lt;N\\land d\\le k\\land d\\mid N)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FACTOR}\\in\\mathbf{BQP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{FACTOR}\\in\\mathbf{BQP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>前两节同时给出搜索结论与判定推论：量子电路测量结果经确定型多项式后处理产生已排序质因数及其正指数的编码；判定语言询问是否有不超过阈值的非平凡因子。素数谓词、非平凡条件、概率分布、后处理输入和列表输出均显式定义。</p>\n<p>列表先写项数，再依次写各正整数的自分隔二进制块，因而唯一可解码。正确因数列表的总码长为输入位数的多项式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FACTOR}\">\\(\\mathsf{FACTOR}\\)</span> 的非法配对编码不在语言内，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d&lt;N\">\\(d&lt;N\\)</span> 排除输入自身。</p>\n<p>原包出处：Arora–Barak, Theorem 10.15; §10.6，印刷页 222–228；PDF 页 248–254。这里补齐编码和类型；Shor 算法全部数论、门逼近与成功率的证明核验限制沿用原包。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-bqp","status":"resolved","id":"c0486b96e648a9d6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-bqp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-quantum-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"b4588e429e73283a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-quantum-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","loca